AIR QUALITY DATA CATALOG(clean_data Schema)

OVERVIEW:
This catalog explains the curated analytical views used for reporting and dashboarding. 
These views abstract the underlying cleaned storage tables, providing standardized column names, consistent data types, and clear business metrics for air quality tracking across cities and stations.

DIMENSION TABLE:

clean_data.dim_station

Description: Master dimension table containing descriptive attributes for each air quality monitoring station.
Grain: One row per unique monitoring station(station_id)
Source Lineage: data_cleaning.station

|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  COLUMN NAME     |    DATA TYPE (logical)    |  DESCRIPTION                                                              |
| -----------------|---------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
|   station_id     |    Varchar/Identifier     |  Unique alphanumeric identifier for the monitoring station (Primary Key)  |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|   station_name   |    Varchar/Text           |  Cleaned, human-readable name of the monitoring station.                  |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  city            |    Varchar/Text           |  The city where the station is physically located.                        |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  station_name    |    Varchar/Text           |  The state where the monitoring station is located.                       |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|

FACT TABLES:
A. Station-level Fact Views
clean_data.fact_station_day

Description: Daily aggregated air quality and pollutant measurements captured at individual monitoring stations.
Grain: One row per station per calendar day.
Source Lineage: data_cleaning.station_day

clean_data.fact_station_hour

Description: Hourly granular air quality and pollutant measurements captured at individual monitoring stations.
Grains: One row per station per hour.
Source Lineage: data_cleaning.station_hour

