|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| record_date/time |  Date / DateTime          |  Timestamp or date of the recorded observation.                           |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  pm2_5           | Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3) |  Particulate Matter 2.5 concentration level.                              |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  pm_10           |Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3)  |  Particulate Matter 10 concentration level.                               |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  no_2            | Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3) |  Nitrogen Dioxide concentration level.                                    |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  nh_3            |Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3)  |  Ammonia concentration level.                                             |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  co              | Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3) |  Carbon Monoxide concentration level.                                     |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  so_2            |Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3)  |  Sulfur Dioxide concentration level.                                      |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  o_3             | Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3) |  Ozone concentration level.                                               |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  benzene         |Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3)  |  Benzene concentration level.                                             |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  toluene         | Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3) |  Toluene concentration level.                                             |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  xylene          |Pollutant Metric(mug/m^3)  |  Xylene concentration level.                                              |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  aqi             | Air Quality Index         |  Calculated overall Air Quality Index value.                              |
|------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|  aqi_bucket      | Qualitative Category      |  Categorical bucket description of AQI severity                           |
|                  |                           |   (e.g., Good, Moderate, Poor, Data Missing                               |
