B. City-Level Fact Views
clean_data.fact_city_day
Description: Daily aggregated air quality and pollutant metrics summarized at the city level.

Grain: One row per city per calendar day.

Source Lineage: data_cleaning.city_day

clean_data.fact_city_hour
Description: Hourly air quality and pollutant metrics summarized at the city level.

Grain: One row per city per hour.

Source Lineage: data_cleaning.city_hour

